// HZM coop - "give all" weapon list (read by the engine GiveCheat when a player runs "give all").
// Overrides the base list so the DEBUG "Give All Guns" key hands you EVERY gun at once - the engine holds
// multiple per category, so you just scroll through them all with the weapon wheel / number keys.
// Guns + grenades/smoke + the Gewehrgranate rifle-grenade. Format: weapon weapons/<file>.tik
// Grenades have startammo 0, so developer.scr::give_all_weapons grants grenade AMMO after "give all".

// US
weapon weapons/m1_garand.tik
weapon weapons/thompsonsmg.tik
weapon weapons/bar.tik
weapon weapons/springfield.tik
weapon weapons/shotgun.tik
weapon weapons/coop_dbshotgun.tik	//[dbshotgun 2026-10-13]
weapon weapons/colt45.tik
weapon weapons/silencedpistol.tik
weapon weapons/bazooka.tik

// German
weapon weapons/mp40.tik
weapon weapons/mp44.tik
weapon weapons/kar98.tik
weapon weapons/KAR98sniper.tik
weapon weapons/g43.tik
weapon weapons/p38.tik
weapon weapons/panzerschreck.tik
weapon weapons/mg42carryable.tik
// PORTABLE (handheld) MG42 - belt-fed LMG from the S93 Extra WW2 pack (own model + reload anim + animated
// ammo belt). The proper sibling of 30calportable; name fixed BAR->MG42, sound -> coop mg42_gun_snd_fire.
weapon weapons/mg42portable.tik
// FG42 REVIVED for testing (mod override models/weapons/FG42.tik): vanilla one was invisible (undefined
// shader -> pointed surface at its own texture) + single-shot (removed `semiauto`, firedelay 0.09 = full
// auto). CAVEAT: fg42.skd is a single-worldbone mesh with a 110-byte stub .skc, so it's a STATIC prop -
// no reload/recoil/muzzle-tag animation (no rigged parts). Testable to judge the model; a real fire/reload
// rig would need a proper model+anim import (none exists in any pack we have).
weapon weapons/FG42.tik

